  ('State the asymptotes, domain and range of y = 2/x − 1.', 'The denominator excludes x = 0, giving the vertical asymptote x = 0 and domain x ≠ 0. The horizontal asymptote is y = −1. Since 2/x cannot be zero, the range is y ≠ −1.'),
