  ('A and B are complementary events. If P(A) = 0.28, find P(B) and P(A ∩ B).', 'Complementary events have probabilities summing to 1, so P(B) = 1 − 0.28 = 0.72. They cannot both occur, so P(A ∩ B) = 0.'),
