  ('In triangle ABC, D and E are the midpoints of AB and AC. DE = 7 cm. Find BC and state the relationship between DE and BC.', 'By the midpoint theorem, DE is parallel to BC and DE = BC/2. Therefore BC = 2 × 7 = 14 cm.'),
