  ('In a group of 80 learners, 30 cycle and 18 of the cyclists run. There are 40 runners altogether. Find P(cycle | run).', 'The condition restricts the sample space to 40 runners. Among them, 18 cycle. Therefore P(cycle | run) = 18/40 = 9/20 = 0.45.'),
