  ('Two 12 Ω resistors are connected in parallel across a 6 V supply. Find total resistance and total current.', '1/R = 1/12 + 1/12 = 1/6, so R = 6 Ω. Total current = V/R = 6/6 = 1 A. Each branch carries 6/12 = 0.5 A.'),
